  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "n-oJohIBMPwAaXTNJ9kQK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 328.53857421875,
      "y": 483.38555908203125,
      "width": 721.37890625,
      "height": 459,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1219568685,
      "version": 697,
      "versionNonce": 335015405,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776566595788,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement:\n\n1. invoice ingestion - based on the frequency.\n2. invoice validation\n3. Transformation if needed\n4. peppol network - secure connection(data transmission to ASP)\n5. audit and tracking --  keeping logs and status updates for compliance.\n\n\nInterface layer -- a portal for manual users and API's for automated integration. \n\nAfter Compliance, additional business steps.\n\n1. validated invoice sending to UAE (FDA)\n2. invoice deliver to customer\n3. Error handling.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement:\n\n1. invoice ingestion - based on the frequency.\n2. invoice validation\n3. Transformation if needed\n4. peppol network - secure connection(data transmission to ASP)\n5. audit and tracking --  keeping logs and status updates for compliance.\n\n\nInterface layer -- a portal for manual users and API's for automated integration. \n\nAfter Compliance, additional business steps.\n\n1. validated invoice sending to UAE (FDA)\n2. invoice deliver to customer\n3. Error handling.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "W7WOnzsQRKbFkxzwhI1HJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1051.283447265625,
      "y": 487.02215576171875,
      "width": 563.6793212890625,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1139848589,
      "version": 658,
      "versionNonce": 16799555,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776521599591,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirements:\n1. scalability - handling high volumes.\n2. Reliability - system availability\n3. security (encryption, access control)\n4. Performance - low latency\n5. maintanability - ease of updates\n6. compliance - ensuring platform meets regulatory standards.\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirements:\n1. scalability - handling high volumes.\n2. Reliability - system availability\n3. security (encryption, access control)\n4. Performance - low latency\n5. maintanability - ease of updates\n6. compliance - ensuring platform meets regulatory standards.\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "2wE2D8Zt6qZ_rG7xzK6W5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 179,
      "width": 1074.278564453125,
      "height": 108,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2015343149,
      "version": 358,
      "versionNonce": 2055679651,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776482826643,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Accredited Service Providers (ASP) for UAE’s national e-invoicing platform. Their platform typically does 3 main things.\n1. invoice validation - checks whether invoice data follows the UAE PINT-AE standards.\n2. Secure invoice exchange - invoices transmitted through peppol network between companies.\n3. Tax Reporting - Invoice data is automatically reported to the Federal Tax Authority(FTA).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Accredited Service Providers (ASP) for UAE’s national e-invoicing platform. Their platform typically does 3 main things.\n1. invoice validation - checks whether invoice data follows the UAE PINT-AE standards.\n2. Secure invoice exchange - invoices transmitted through peppol network between companies.\n3. Tax Reporting - Invoice data is automatically reported to the Federal Tax Authority(FTA).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "TXIOb8GszIol1qrVNzzgH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 423.5752663676909,
      "y": 1054.233162465798,
      "width": 996.4186401367188,
      "height": 189,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 231511213,
      "version": 695,
      "versionNonce": 349835075,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776567298518,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Design:\n1.  POST /invoices submission API - receive invoice from ERP, accept JSON/XML, trigger valiadation workflow\n2. GET / Invoices/{invoiceId}/status - received, validated, rejected, transmitted, delivered.\n3. GET/ Invoices/{invoiceId}/errors - missing VAT number, invalid format, duplicated invoices, schema mismatch.\n4. POST/ invoices/{invoiceId}/resubmit - corrected one\n5. Webhook or callback mechanism - instead of cliend polling everytime, our platform can push updates back.\n            invoice validated, rejected , delivered.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Design:\n1.  POST /invoices submission API - receive invoice from ERP, accept JSON/XML, trigger valiadation workflow\n2. GET / Invoices/{invoiceId}/status - received, validated, rejected, transmitted, delivered.\n3. GET/ Invoices/{invoiceId}/errors - missing VAT number, invalid format, duplicated invoices, schema mismatch.\n4. POST/ invoices/{invoiceId}/resubmit - corrected one\n5. Webhook or callback mechanism - instead of cliend polling everytime, our platform can push updates back.\n            invoice validated, rejected , delivered.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "2jFcSbyHGAtnCpZ2M-JMo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1524.0069527083467,
      "y": 978.4918834488064,
      "width": 317.7196044921875,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 911517293,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1745202989,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776523893898,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional API requirements\n\nYour API layer should also support:\n\nhigh availability\nlow latency\nretry handling\nobservability\nversioning\nscalability for high invoice volumes",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional API requirements\n\nYour API layer should also support:\n\nhigh availability\nlow latency\nretry handling\nobservability\nversioning\nscalability for high invoice volumes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "9f8B8ZPXotl164zTSGUBg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -156.32119111034342,
      "y": 500.46518056628065,
      "width": 283.5196228027344,
      "height": 324,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 850242019,
      "version": 60,
      "versionNonce": 1695049741,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776568022769,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Estimation buckets\n\nClient onboarding scale\nTransaction volume\nPeak concurrency\nAPI throughput\nQueue/event throughput\nCompute processing load\nStorage and retention\nNetwork bandwidth\nExternal integration constraints\nHA/DR recovery load",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Estimation buckets\n\nClient onboarding scale\nTransaction volume\nPeak concurrency\nAPI throughput\nQueue/event throughput\nCompute processing load\nStorage and retention\nNetwork bandwidth\nExternal integration constraints\nHA/DR recovery load",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "P_hk4cfKUnHvogN0x5Ow7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -592.7435256303445,
      "y": 883.8375197604026,
      "width": 758.39892578125,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1662924291,
      "version": 473,
      "versionNonce": 324446477,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776568035303,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Daily volume = organizations × invoices per org per day\nPeak hourly volume = daily volume × peak concentration factor\nEvents per day = invoices per day × events per invoice\nStorage per day = invoices per day × average payload size × copies/retention pattern\nRequired throughput = peak transactions / second with safety margin",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Daily volume = organizations × invoices per org per day\nPeak hourly volume = daily volume × peak concentration factor\nEvents per day = invoices per day × events per invoice\nStorage per day = invoices per day × average payload size × copies/retention pattern\nRequired throughput = peak transactions / second with safety margin",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
